AiLink is a smart hardware management APP

AiLink is a comprehensive intelligent hardware management platform. Through the AiLink App, you can ensure the convenient and fast interaction between the mobile phone and the intelligent hardware, and realize the connection of data. You can also share data with other friends and family through the friends feature.

Multiple smart device management
It is possible to add devices quickly and collect the analyzed data from different products;

Cloud data storage - All data is associated with your account, so measurement data will not be lost even if you lose your mobile or uninstall the program;

Friend's data, sharing results
The application allows the implementation of data exchange between friends and family through the friends function;

Family management
Different addresses and devices are managed separately - therefore, data management is more monvenient and effective;

And more features…

HealthKit
You can record your body information through the body fat scale device ->Settings->Personal Center->Apple Health.
